@layout DefaultLayout
@page "/portfolio/lostinstatic"

@{
	var canonicalUrl = "https://fydar.dev/portfolio/lostinstatic";
	void PageMetadata(IMetadataFactory factory)
	{
		factory.UseTitle("Lost in Static - Fydar");
		factory.UseDescription("Remote control a drone to take down a rogue AI controlling the station.");
		factory.UseCanonicalUrl(canonicalUrl);
		factory.UseImage(image =>
		{
			image.Url = "https://fydar.dev/media/lostinstatic/social.webp";
			image.Alt = "Promotional material for the game 'Lost in Static'.";
		});
	}
	var breadcrumbs = new BreadcrumbList()
	{
		new BreadcrumbListItem("Portfolio", "https://fydar.dev/portfolio"),
		new BreadcrumbListItem("Lost in Static", "https://fydar.dev/portfolio/lostinstatic"),
	};
}

<HeadFragment>
	<MetadataComponent Metadata="@PageMetadata" />
	<BreadcrumbListComponent Model="@breadcrumbs" />
</HeadFragment>

<article class="page-lostinstatic">

    <div class="fullscreen" data-nosnippet>
        <div class="parallax-frame parallax-focalanchortop" style="--animation-time: 0.5;">
            <picture class="parallax-layer" style="--parallax-multiplier: 0.5">
                <img decoding="async" src="@Assets["media/lostinstatic/background.webp"]" />
            </picture>
        </div>

        <div class="fullscreen-footer">
            <div class="container">
                <picture>
                    <img decoding="async" class="titlecard" src="@Assets["media/lostinstatic/titlecard.svg"]" alt="Title card for the game 'Lost in Static'." />
                </picture>

                <div class="titlerow">
                    <div class="flexible-space"></div>
                    <SteamPlayButton href="/play/lostinstatic">Play in Browser</SteamPlayButton>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cascade-container">
            <div class="cascade" style="background: linear-gradient(to right, #9685aa00 0%, #9685aa30 75%, #9685aa14 100%), url('media/noise.svg');">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
        <Block_ArticleHeader>
            <h1 data-nosnippet><cite>Lost in Static</cite> <span class="subtle">(2018)</span></h1>
        </Block_ArticleHeader>

        <Block_ArticleIntroduction>
            <Sidebar>
                <img decoding="async" class="article-featuredimage" src="@Assets["media/lostinstatic/social.webp"]" alt="Promotional material for the game 'Lost in Static'." />

                <Block_PillCloud>
                    <Pill_GameJam />
                    <Pill_Unity />
                    <Pill_CSharp />
                </Block_PillCloud>

                <p>Remote control a drone to take down a rogue AI controlling the station.</p>

                <menu class="externallinks" aria-label="Project External links">
                    <li class="palette-youtube"><a href="https://youtu.be/Pms5NU5-IHQ" target="_blank"><SvgSprite Link="/icons.svg?v=1#icon-youtube" Alt="YouTube" /></a></li>
                </menu>

                <ShareLink Url="@canonicalUrl" />
            </Sidebar>
            <Container>
                <EmbedYouTube Url="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/Pms5NU5-IHQ?si=Mrgnpsi5yvvkqaqR" />
            </Container>
        </Block_ArticleIntroduction>

        <Block_ArticleOutlined>
            <Sidebar>
                <aside>
                    <Block_TableOfContents />
                </aside>
            </Sidebar>
            <Content>

                <OutlineSection Id="character-controller" LinkName="Character Controller">
                    <Block_ArticleHeading>
                        <hgroup>
                            <p>Implementing the</p>
                            <h2>Character Controller</h2>
                        </hgroup>
                    </Block_ArticleHeading>

                    <p>This was my first team game jam, held at the Unity office in Brighton. After forming a team, we decided to make a game where the player remotely pilots a drone through a space station's CCTV network to shut down a rogue AI. I implemented the drone's character controller, handling its movement and physical interactions within the station environment.</p>

                </OutlineSection>

                <OutlineSection Id="cameras" LinkName="Camera Controllers">
                    <Block_ArticleHeading>
                        <hgroup>
                            <p>Implementing the</p>
                            <h2>Camera Controllers</h2>
                        </hgroup>
                    </Block_ArticleHeading>

                    <p>The central mechanic of hopping between CCTV feeds to track and control the drone required a flexible camera controller system capable of smooth transitions between multiple viewpoints, each with its own position, orientation, and field of view.</p>

                </OutlineSection>

                <OutlineSection Id="glitching-ui" LinkName="Glitching UI">
                    <Block_ArticleHeading>
                        <hgroup>
                            <p>Implementing the</p>
                            <h2>Glitching UI</h2>
                        </hgroup>
                    </Block_ArticleHeading>

                    <p>To sell the feeling of navigating a corrupted station network, I built glitch effects for the UI, including screen tears, colour channel shifts, and frame corruption, all triggered as the rogue AI fights back against the player's intrusion between camera transitions.</p>

                    <Block_Callout Type="construction">
                        <Icon><SvgSprite Link="/icons.svg?v=1#fluent-emoji-high-contrast--construction" Alt="Check" /></Icon>
                        <ChildContent>This section of my website is currently <b>under construction</b>.</ChildContent>
                    </Block_Callout>
                </OutlineSection>

            </Content>
        </Block_ArticleOutlined>
    </div>
</article>

<PwaInstall AppId="lostinstatic"
            Scope="/play/lostinstatic"
            ServiceWorkerUrl="@Assets["play/lostinstatic.serviceworker.js"]"
            ManifestUrl="@Assets["/play/lostinstatic/manifest.webmanifest"]" />
